# Inputs for requirements-ansible.txt (Spec 006 section 6.3): ansible-core for the M2 playbooks and
# the workstation installer's runtime dependencies, so one virtual environment runs ansible-playbook
# and jwicket-install. The installer wheel itself is installed afterwards with pip --no-deps.
